        </div>
        <p class="lbp-review__quote">&ldquo;Always order from this lovely lady, she has the most beautiful stuff and if she doesn't have it, she tries her best to get you what you're looking for &mdash; always fast delivery and best prices. Would highly recommend, ordering from her for years and will continue to.&rdquo;</p>
        <p class="lbp-review__author">Facebook review</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lbp-review lbp-reveal" data-delay="1">
        <div class="lbp-stars" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="is-on" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10 1l2.6 5.9 6.4.6-4.8 4.3 1.4 6.2L10 14.9 4.4 18l1.4-6.2L1 7.5l6.4-.6z"/></svg>
